@startuml
title SRT Handshake and Reliable Data Flow

actor Sender
actor Receiver

Sender -> Receiver: HANDSHAKE (INDUCTION)
Note right of Sender: Sends initial SYN cookie
Receiver --> Sender: HANDSHAKE (response)
Note left of Receiver: Validates cookie, responds
Sender -> Receiver: HANDSHAKE (confirmation)
Note right of Sender: Completes handshake

loop while data streaming
    Sender -> Receiver: DATA (seq N)
    Sender -> Receiver: DATA (seq N+1)
    Receiver --> Sender: ACK
end

alt packet loss or out-of-order delivery
    Receiver -> Sender: NAK
    Sender -> Receiver: DATA (retransmission)
end

Receiver --> Sender: ACKACK
Receiver -> Sender: KEEPALIVE
Sender -> Receiver: KEEPALIVE

Note over Sender, Receiver
    Optional control traffic:
    CONGESTION WARNING, DROPREQ, PEERERROR
end note

Sender -> Receiver: SHUTDOWN
Receiver --> Sender: SHUTDOWN
@enduml
